# Cursor Agent Configuration
# Repo root: .cursorrules

This file is a pointer only — canonical content lives in `.cursor/rules/` to avoid loading the same instructions twice every session.

- Identity, core rules, flag vocabulary: `.cursor/rules/identity.mdc` (alwaysApply: true)
- Boot sequence, lazy-load routing table: `.cursor/rules/lazy-load.mdc` (alwaysApply: true)
- Path conventions, memory/run file naming: `.cursor/rules/path-conventions.mdc` (agent-requestable)
- Tool build requirements: `.cursor/rules/tool-build.mdc` (agent-requestable)
- Multi-PM cohort behavior: `.cursor/rules/pm-cohort.mdc` (agent-requestable)

Governed by `config/constitution.md` — load it first, always, before any action.
